{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Fallow City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564940/extras/GameLogo.png?t=1741765552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Fallow City is an Indie Horror, Action-Adventure, Story game where you play as Ajay who is on his way to escape the apocalyptic city along with his younger brother Aayu. On their way out to city they face many zombies, challenges and twists. But the question is can they escape this city full of monsters and problem?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564940/extras/SepratingLine.png?t=1741765552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Demo features the first chapter of the game, where player get to experience what the game is like and how the story will be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564940/extras/SepratingLine.png?t=1741765552\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2022 Story Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2022 Shooter Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2022 Shoot, Collect, Craft, Shoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2022 Overcome Obstacles and Solve puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2022 Different types of zombies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2022 Boss Fight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2022 Different Guns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2022 Semi Realistic Graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2022 Atmospheric </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2022 Mostly Dark and Horror\u00a0Environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2022 Voiced Characters</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/ima